# Curse of Opulence enchanting Bot2 (CR 303.4): "Whenever enchanted player is attacked, create a Gold token." Bot1 attacks Bot2 with two creatures on turn 3 and the trigger happens once for the combat (one or more creatures attacking), so Bot1 gets one Gold; "each opponent attacking that player does the same" adds
# nobody else. The Gold token is an artifact that sacrifices for one mana of any color: {R}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Curse of Opulence
Ornithopter
Haywire Mite
Mountain x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Haywire Mite.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Curse of Opulence.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter; Haywire Mite > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Gold Token.Activate(Color: Red)
? Bot1.Mana = {R}

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 5
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
